    <!--
      No reference to the Cocoa/WPF MonoDevelop.TextEditor add-in (excluded, ADR 0012): its command mapping
      and context-menu extensions are removed from the manifest; the GTK source editor (SourceEditor2) is the editor.
      Xamarin.Mac (DebugMac/ReleaseMac configurations only) is not referenced on Linux.
    -->
